  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 pounds potatoes, peeled and cubed",
    "4 slices bacon",
    "0.5 small head cabbage, chopped",
    "1 large onion, chopped",
    "0.5 cup milk",
    "salt and pepper to taste",
    "0.25 cup butter, melted"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/e8perLpEwCJTTaJ4TvBVwewZj2E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot1_12408-78da91cc8c1045dc9afb3baa2dc195c9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes into a saucepan with enough water to cover. Bring to a boil and cook until tender, 15 to 20 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uPupBYabqNm7ozLM7RCdwvf9nYo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot2_12423-31d18089bf544d19a1a7bd301f2e87e1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While pototoes are cooking, cook bacon in a large skillet over medium-high heat, turning occasionally, until evenly browned, about 10 minutes. Drain bacon slices on paper towels; crumble and set aside. Reserve drippings in the skillet.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fx3qS4o4lBSrNXm5E5iRaZL2pvU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot3_12430-e7837a358f934e4e980448e4d6c0d349.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sauté cabbage and onion in drippings in the skillet over medium heat until soft and translucent, 10 to 15 minutes; cover the skillet to decrease cooking time if desired. Remove from heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/RTVGLH_Zhv0BeZ2KDs4MjEvnhQc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot4_12442-8db6f137c8214407b68acae9f2704ea5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mash potatoes with milk in a large bowl; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H_Ikc23-BhlVF2F0ohghG1NxTXg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot5_12450-371ad780748b42c28de962abc2387270.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fold in bacon, cabbage and onion.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i9Eiz4yDz8wrQ8vSryEplIM7iOE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_Shot6_12457-0b6761bc5c864ff89f72b0f582ec37cc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer mixture to a large serving bowl. Make a well in the center of potato mixture and pour in melted butter. Serve hot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/daxEjrVSK1kYyeiSC7W6heO0V0U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_58642_DianesColcannon_4x3_12499-9b39d168e55d4a088fefe17eecf0cae7.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/58642/step_07.webp"
    }
